# contracts-v1.4 Signature Lock attestation (model phase)
#
# This file is a human-readable placeholder for the certificate-v1 model.
# Normative authenticity binding is defined by:
#   manifest/release-certificate.json
# with signing.method = "certificate-v1" and signing.status = "model".
#
# contracts-v1.4 (Sigstore Verification) adds cryptographic provenance:
# a cosign bundle over manifest/contracts-v1.4.json, produced by
#   .github/workflows/sign-release.yml
# on the release tag and published as the Release asset
#   contracts-v1.4.bundle
# The bundle is not committed (it would be circular with the manifest).
#
# Do not treat this placeholder as a cryptographic signature.
